[{"id":3093388070,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64YVsm","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nSince this uses TextServer now, it might be worth a second look from @bruvzg.\r\n\r\nHowever, this has a strange effect on the MRP if you call this in `_ready()` in the MRP:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tget_viewport().oversampling_override = 0.1\r\n```\r\n\r\nLines become much thicker and the antialiasing is mostly gone:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2716\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5518c3c6-2a7d-4c4b-bdc1-0efbb2b88357\" />\r\n\r\nWith the value set to `0.1`, you can see the issue more clearly:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2129\" height=\"1283\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6aacd5c1-7e63-4e7d-a39d-440860af5f6c\" />\r\n\r\nI'm not sure to which degree this is intended.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109358#pullrequestreview-3093388070","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109358","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-06T16:20:57Z"},{"id":3093400750,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64YYyu","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.co